        "<b>Связаться со мной:</b>\n\n"
        "📱 Telegram: @Mersinwellness\n"
        "📞 WhatsApp: +90 520 592 88\n"
        "📍 Mersin, Mezitli, Davultepe, Soray-2",
        parse_mode="HTML"
